sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户/定时器
    participant FS as fetcherService
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant VS as v6ScoreService
    participant HS as hotSectorAnalyzer
    participant VP as valuePitAnalyzer
    participant RS as rotationScoreService
    participant DS as dualStrategyEngine
    participant SG as signalGenerator
    participant TS as tradingService
    participant TR as tradeReviewAI
    participant DC as data-collector
    participant EP as executionPlanService
    participant PF as portfolioService
    participant EL as executionLogService

    Note over U,TR: P1 采集 → P3 V6评分 → P4 双策略 → P5 轮动 → P6 信号 → P7 交易 → P8 复盘

    U->>FS: 触发采集 (symbol)
    FS->>IDB: put stocks, daily_quotes
    IDB-->>FS: ok

    U->>VS: runV6Score(symbol)
    VS->>IDB: get stocks, daily_quotes
    IDB-->>VS: data
    VS->>VS: calculate factors (L0-L8)
    VS->>IDB: put v6_scores
    IDB-->>VS: ok

    U->>HS: analyzeHotSectors(stocks)
    HS->>IDB: get stocks, daily_quotes, v6_scores
    IDB-->>HS: data
    HS->>HS: 五维评分 (动量/情绪/技术/估值/大盘)
    HS->>IDB: put hot_sector_scores
    IDB-->>HS: ok

    U->>VP: analyzeValuePits(stocks)
    VP->>IDB: get stocks, daily_quotes, v6_scores
    IDB-->>VP: data
    VP->>VP: 五维评分 (催化/估值/筹码/轮动/流动性)
    VP->>IDB: put value_pit_scores
    IDB-->>VP: ok

    U->>RS: calculateRotationScore(sector)
    RS->>IDB: get value_pit_scores, sector_scores
    IDB-->>RS: data
    RS->>RS: 五因子合成 + 共振度计算
    RS->>IDB: put rotation_scores
    IDB-->>RS: ok

    U->>DS: runDualStrategy(stocks)
    DS->>IDB: get hot_sector_scores, value_pit_scores
    IDB-->>DS: data
    DS->>DS: detect rotation signals
    DS->>IDB: put signals (rotation)
    IDB-->>DS: ok

    U->>SG: generateSignalsForSymbol(symbol)
    SG->>IDB: get stocks, daily_quotes, v6_scores
    IDB-->>SG: data
    SG->>SG: 技术指标 + 共振综合
    SG->>IDB: put signals (technical)
    IDB-->>SG: ok

    U->>TS: createBuyOrder(signal)
    TS->>TS: risk check
    TS->>IDB: put orders
    IDB-->>TS: ok

    U->>TR: generateReview(orders)
    TR->>IDB: get orders, daily_quotes
    IDB-->>TR: data
    TR->>TR: 错误分类 / 纪律分析 / 筹码波动复盘
    TR-->>U: TradeReviewReport

    Note over U,IDB: P12 缺失报告 → P13 执行计划 → P14 投资组合 → P15 执行日志

    DC->>IDB: put missing_reports
    IDB-->>DC: ok

    U->>EP: createPlan(signal)
    EP->>IDB: put executionPlans
    IDB-->>EP: ok

    U->>PF: rebalancePortfolio(plan, orders)
    PF->>IDB: get orders, executionPlans
    IDB-->>PF: data
    PF->>IDB: put portfolios
    IDB-->>PF: ok

    EP->>EL: writeLog(plan)
    EL->>IDB: put execution_logs
    IDB-->>EL: ok
